// The App Group the widget extension and the app share.
//
// It is a build setting, not a literal in Swift: a re-signed install has to use a
// group registered to *its own* team, and rewriting a plist is something a
// sideload tool or a shell script can do without an Xcode build. The resolved
// value lands in both Info.plists as `LazerAppGroupIdentifier`, which is what the
// Swift code reads at runtime.
LAZER_APP_GROUP_IDENTIFIER = group.dev.naominet.lazer
